WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.840
Thanks to your bold leadership and the designation of Antifa as a terrorist organization, which

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:12.080
is exactly what they are, Americans will no longer tolerate their unhinged violence.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.080
Thank you.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.080
Thank you very much, Pam.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.080
Christine.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:20.480
Well, thank you, Mr. President, and thank you for hosting today and focusing on Antifa

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.879
and the terrorists that they are.

00:00:22.879 --> 00:00:24.480
Let's not make any mistake.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:28.680
These individuals do not just want to threaten our law enforcement officers, threaten our

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:31.160
journalists, and the citizens of this country.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:32.720
They want to kill them.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:37.400
Their agenda is to destroy the American people in our way of life, and this president is

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.880
standing in their way.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:43.799
He is stopping them from bringing their death and their destruction to the individual citizens

00:00:43.799 --> 00:00:48.599
in this country that just want to raise their kids and their grandkids in peace and in safety.

00:00:48.599 --> 00:00:52.439
I want to also thank everyone around this table for being so bold and so brave, for

00:00:52.439 --> 00:00:57.619
standing up and recognizing the threat that Antifa is to our way of life.

00:00:57.619 --> 00:01:02.139
By recognizing how advanced they are, how sophisticated their networks are, how they've

00:01:02.139 --> 00:01:06.540
infiltrated our entire country, and we're seeing them play out with their tactics from

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:11.980
city to city, and how they have built out their funding mechanisms, and sir, I also

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:17.779
want to thank our Treasury Secretary for his work in getting to the bottom of these funding

00:01:17.779 --> 00:01:22.620
mechanisms and individuals who are perpetuating this violence on our American cities.

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:26.860
I was in Portland yesterday and had the chance to visit with the governor of Oregon and also

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:27.860
the mayor.

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:35.099
They're in town and they are absolutely covering up the terrorism that is hitting their streets.

00:01:35.099 --> 00:01:39.660
While you talked about some of the stories of our ICE agents, our Border Patrol agents,

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:44.820
how they have been attacked, how they have been shot at, injured, the damage that they've

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:49.940
done, these leaders in these local cities, along with Pritzker and Johnson, ignore what's

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:53.339
going on, or sir, they're helping Antifa cover it up.

00:01:53.339 --> 00:01:59.220
We have arrested dozens of individuals that are Antifa members or affiliated with them,

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:02.820
and I want to thank our Attorney General for prosecuting them and making sure they never

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:04.580
see the light of day again.

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:08.139
They have been so bold in making sure we're bringing those individuals to justice.

00:02:08.139 --> 00:02:12.779
One of the individuals we arrested recently in Portland was the girlfriend of one of the

00:02:12.779 --> 00:02:17.539
founders of Antifa, and that we are hoping that as we go after her, interview her, and

00:02:17.539 --> 00:02:21.940
prosecute her, we will get more and more information about the network and how we can root them

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:26.899
out and eliminate them from the existence of American society.

00:02:26.899 --> 00:02:31.500
I want to thank the new journalists here today for telling their stories and for being able

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:35.660
and willing to go to the streets and to cover what's happening here in America.

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:39.580
Many times the legacy media has looked the other way, refused to tell the stories.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:45.220
The networks have not really focused on what this is and what damage it is doing to our

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:51.699
country and how this network of Antifa is just as sophisticated as MS-13, as TDA, as

00:02:51.699 --> 00:02:55.220
ISIS, as Hezbollah, as Hamas, as all of them.

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:56.779
They are just as dangerous.

00:02:56.779 --> 00:03:00.500
They have an agenda to destroy us, just like the other terrorists we've dealt with for

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.059
many, many years.

00:03:02.059 --> 00:03:06.139
And today is the day that we have a president that won't tolerate it and will stand up and

00:03:06.139 --> 00:03:07.500
fight for the American people.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:12.279
So thank you for being here, for being so bold and for standing in the gap at such a

00:03:12.279 --> 00:03:13.279
time as this.

00:03:13.279 --> 00:03:14.279
It will matter.

00:03:14.339 --> 00:03:17.360
And the fact that you can make a difference in your life will be one of significance because

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:18.639
of what you've done today.

00:03:18.639 --> 00:03:20.240
So with that, God bless you.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:21.240
And thank you, Mr. President.

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:22.240
Thank you very much.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.240
Thank you.

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:24.240
Cash, please.

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.240
Thank you, Mr. President.

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:30.199
Mr. President, the American people gave you a sweeping mandate in your victory in this

00:03:30.199 --> 00:03:34.139
election cycle, and they demanded safety and security for our citizens.

00:03:34.139 --> 00:03:37.399
And your administration, with your leadership, has provided us with the resources that we

00:03:37.399 --> 00:03:42.720
need, which is a whole-of-government approach to go after criminals absolutely everywhere,

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:45.539
not just outside of this country, but within this country.

00:03:45.539 --> 00:03:47.360
And that takes a whole-of-government approach.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:51.800
The interagency seated up here with the Department of Homeland Security, our Attorney General,

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:56.759
Deputy Attorney General, and your White House staffers, including Stephen Miller's leadership,

00:03:56.759 --> 00:04:00.360
has allowed us to go out there and map out these networks.

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:02.839
What we are doing at the FBI is simple.

00:04:02.839 --> 00:04:04.679
It does not require rocket science.

00:04:04.679 --> 00:04:07.039
We are following the money.

00:04:07.039 --> 00:04:08.399
Money never lies.

00:04:08.399 --> 00:04:14.240
And that's what it's going to take to bring down this network of organized criminal thugs,

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:18.119
gangbangers, and, yes, domestic terrorists, because that's what they are.

00:04:18.119 --> 00:04:21.839
They are harming everyday citizens in every single one of our communities.

00:04:21.839 --> 00:04:24.359
And the folks you see here on the right and left, they're some of the bravest men and

00:04:24.359 --> 00:04:25.619
women we have today.

00:04:25.619 --> 00:04:29.100
They're reporting the stories live time, because the mainstream media won't cover it.

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:30.839
They're putting their lives on the line.

00:04:30.839 --> 00:04:32.000
They're standing up for the flag.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.200
The least we can do is stand up for them.

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.440
So you have my thanks.

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:39.480
I read more of your stories than I do theirs, because you guys are putting out the truth.

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:43.279
And we deserve a country where you are protected as equally as they are.

00:04:43.279 --> 00:04:47.000
We in this FBI will go after the criminals with a vengeance.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:53.000
We will not rest until we find every single seed, money, donor, organization, and funding

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.640
mechanism that we have.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:59.380
And I want to echo the Secretary's comments on Scott Besson, who's allowing us to map

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:04.019
out these networks through their financial criminal activities, which has been going

00:05:04.019 --> 00:05:05.100
on for decades.

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:09.440
And I would like to remind the American public, they built this disease temple of corruption

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:10.899
over decades.

00:05:10.899 --> 00:05:14.880
And in eight short months, Mr. President, you have crippled their foundation because

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:18.980
of your leadership here, because of the interagency, because of people like Deputy Attorney General

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:23.100
Blanche, and because of Attorney General Pam Bondi's fearless leadership to go after criminals

00:05:23.100 --> 00:05:24.179
wherever they are.

00:05:24.179 --> 00:05:25.440
They will not be able to hide.

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:29.779
They were able to hide and conspire with prior administrations, and we are exposing their

00:05:29.779 --> 00:05:31.579
corruption from within.

00:05:31.579 --> 00:05:35.239
And we will go to every single city in this country under Operation Summer Heat and the

00:05:35.239 --> 00:05:39.260
other operations we are doing at the FBI to bring these criminals to justice.

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:43.579
We will arrest every single one of them from whatever perch you sit in, private or public,

00:05:43.579 --> 00:05:48.660
no matter how high your goal or your ambition is, it will be crushed by the Constitution

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:51.019
because the American people deserve law and order.

00:05:51.019 --> 00:05:53.059
And that's what we're going to give you.

00:05:53.059 --> 00:05:54.059
Thank you very much, Kesh.

00:05:54.059 --> 00:05:54.559
Great job.

